          "end": 12216,
          "context": "Lynch | Lynch | Democratic | MA | Nay |\n MacArthur | MacArthur | Republican | NJ | Yea |\n Maloney, Carolyn B. | Maloney, Carolyn B. | Democratic | NY | Nay |\n"
